{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824131496,"sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9d4e0a2001IoXZBRuqbg3Dv5","sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","messageID":"msg_0b9d4da48001Lhy0WAL09C5Vgx","type":"tool","id":"call_00_GRZ5Vxof330CWfLGfL0D4439","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp && python3 - <<'EOF'\ntext = open('full_text.txt').read()\nprint(text[13000:21000])\nEOF"},"output":"fect the advisory vote to approve specified compensation that may become payable to the named executive officers of the Company in connection with the merger and the vote regarding the adjournment of the special meeting to solicit additional proxies, if necessary or appropriate. \nYour proxy may be revoked at any time before the vote at the special meeting by following the procedures outlined in the accompanying proxy statement. \nBY ORDER OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS\n \nPAULETTE DODSON\nSenior Vice President, General Counsel and Secretary\n \nDated February 2, 2015 \nTABLE OF CONTENTS\n​\nTABLE OF CONTENTS \n​\n​\n​\nPage \n​\nSUMMARY\n​\n​\n​\n​\n1\n \n​\n​\nQUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE SPECIAL MEETING AND THE MERGER\n​\n​\n​\n​\n10\n \n​\n​\nCAUTIONARY STATEMENT CONCERNING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS\n​\n​\n​\n​\n15\n \n​\n​\nTHE PARTIES TO THE MERGER AGREEMENT\n​\n​\n​\n​\n16\n \n​\n​\nPetSmart, Inc. \n​\n​\n​\n​\n16\n \n​\n​\nArgos Holdings, Inc. and Argos Merger Sub \n​\n​\n​\n​\n16\n \n​\n​\nTHE SPECIAL MEETING\n​\n​\n​\n​\n17\n \n​\n​\nDate, Time and Place of the Special Meeting\n​\n​\n​\n​\n17\n \n​\n​\nPurpose of the Special Meeting\n​\n​\n​\n​\n17\n \n​\n​\nRecommendation of the Company’s Board of Directors\n​\n​\n​\n​\n17\n \n​\n​\nRecord Date and Quorum\n​\n​\n​\n​\n17\n \n​\n​\nRequired Vote\n​\n​\n​\n​\n18\n \n​\n​\nVoting by the Company’s Directors and Executive Officers\n​\n​\n​\n​\n18\n \n​\n​\nVoting; Proxies; Revocation\n​\n​\n​\n​\n18\n \n​\n​\nAbstentions\n​\n​\n​\n​\n20\n