{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824140322,"sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9d50243001s45rmXnrsV4eVP","sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","messageID":"msg_0b9d4fb3a001ETbp3lUiXZSkMc","type":"tool","id":"call_00_Cj5qMIVqGWYw1Rxw9Wpf6242","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp && python3 - <<'EOF'\nhtml = open('/home/uctpiaj/work/raw_filing/petsmart_2015-02-02_DEFM14A.htm', encoding='ascii', errors='replace').read()\ni = html.find('Background of the Merger')\nprint(\"first at\", i)\n# find all occurrences\nimport re\nidxs=[m.start() for m in re.finditer('Background of the Merger', html)]\nprint(idxs)\nprint(html[idxs[1]-3000:idxs[1]+500])\nEOF"},"output":"first at 55865\n[55865, 255733, 527267]\nfont-weight:bold;\">Other Information </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">You should not return your stock certificate or send documents representing common stock with the proxy card. If the merger is completed, the paying agent for the merger will send you a letter of transmittal and instructions for exchanging your shares of common stock for the merger consideration. </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:21.71pt;min-width:456pt;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top:5pt; text-align:center; line-height:11pt;\">20</div>\n      </div>\n      <hr >\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"page-break-after:always; font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;\">\n      <div style=\"padding:0pt;margin:0pt;font-family:calibri, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:8pt;line-height:8pt;\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#003366;\" href=\"#TOC\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a><a name=\"tPRO1\">&#8203;</a><a name=\"tPRO101\">&#8203;</a><a name=\"tPRO102\">&#8203;</a></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:46pt;min-width:456pt;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12pt; text-align:center; line-height:11pt;font-weight:bold;\">THE MERGER (PROPOSAL 1) </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12pt; line-height:11pt;font-weight:bold;\">Certain Effects of the Merger </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">If the merger agreement is adopted by the Company&#8217;s stockholders and certain other conditions to the closing of the merger are either satisfied or waived, Merger Sub will be merged with and into the Company with the Company being the surviving corporation in the merger. </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">Upon the consummation of the merger each share of common stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the merger (other than shares owned by the Company, any of its subsidiaries, Parent, any direct or indirect holding company of Parent, Merger Sub and holders who are entitled to and properly exercise appraisal rights under Delaware law) will be converted into the right to receive $83.00 in cash. </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">Our common stock is currently registered under the Exchange Act and is quoted on the NASDAQ under the symbol &#8220;PETM.&#8221; As a result of the merger, the Company will cease to be a publicly traded company and will be wholly owned by Parent. Following the consummation of the merger, the registration of our common stock and our reporting obligations under the Exchange Act will be terminated. In addition, upon the consummation of the merger, our common stock will no longer be listed on any stock exchange or quotation system, including the NASDAQ. </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12pt; line-height:11pt;font-weight:bold;\">Background of the Merger </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">The board frequently reviews, with the Company&#8217;s management and with the assistance of financial and legal advisors, the Company&#8217;s strategic and financial alternatives in light of developments in the Company&#8217;s business, in the sectors in which it competes, in the economy generally and in financial markets. The alternatives reviewed have included large and small acquisitions,\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"first at 55865\n[55865, 255733, 527267]\nfont-weight:bold;\">Other Information </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">You should not return your stock certificate or send documents representing common stock with the proxy card. If the merger is completed, the paying agent for the merger will send you a letter of transmittal and instructions for exchanging your shares of common stock for the merger consideration. </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:21.71pt;min-width:456pt;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top:5pt; text-align:center; line-height:11pt;\">20</div>\n      </div>\n      <hr >\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"page-break-after:always; font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-variant:normal;text-transform:none;color:#000000;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;\">\n      <div style=\"padding:0pt;margin:0pt;font-family:calibri, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:8pt;line-height:8pt;\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#003366;\" href=\"#TOC\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a><a name=\"tPRO1\">&#8203;</a><a name=\"tPRO101\">&#8203;</a><a name=\"tPRO102\">&#8203;</a></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:46pt;min-width:456pt;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12pt; text-align:center; line-height:11pt;font-weight:bold;\">THE MERGER (PROPOSAL 1) </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12pt; line-height:11pt;font-weight:bold;\">Certain Effects of the Merger </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">If the merger agreement is adopted by the Company&#8217;s stockholders and certain other conditions to the closing of the merger are either satisfied or waived, Merger Sub will be merged with and into the Company with the Company being the surviving corporation in the merger. </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">Upon the consummation of the merger each share of common stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the merger (other than shares owned by the Company, any of its subsidiaries, Parent, any direct or indirect holding company of Parent, Merger Sub and holders who are entitled to and properly exercise appraisal rights under Delaware law) will be converted into the right to receive $83.00 in cash. </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">Our common stock is currently registered under the Exchange Act and is quoted on the NASDAQ under the symbol &#8220;PETM.&#8221; As a result of the merger, the Company will cease to be a publicly traded company and will be wholly owned by Parent. Following the consummation of the merger, the registration of our common stock and our reporting obligations under the Exchange Act will be terminated. In addition, upon the consummation of the merger, our common stock will no longer be listed on any stock exchange or quotation system, including the NASDAQ. </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12pt; line-height:11pt;font-weight:bold;\">Background of the Merger </div>\n        <div style=\"text-indent:20pt; margin-top:6pt; line-height:12pt;\">The board frequently reviews, with the Company&#8217;s management and with the assistance of financial and legal advisors, the Company&#8217;s strategic and financial alternatives in light of developments in the Company&#8217;s business, in the sectors in which it competes, in the economy generally and in financial markets. The alternatives reviewed have included large and small acquisitions,\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nhtml = open('/home/uctpiaj/work/raw_filing/petsmart_2015-02-02_DEFM14A.htm', encoding='ascii', errors='replace').read()\\ni = html.find('Background of the Merger')\\nprint(\\\"first at\\\", i)\\n# find all occurrences\\nimport re\\nidxs=[m.start() for m in re.finditer('Background of the Merger', html)]\\nprint(idxs)\\nprint(html[idxs[1]-3000:idxs[1]+500])\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824139843,"end":1789824140322}}}}
