{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824763414,"sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9de832d001jz6ySCkqfsPpu1","sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","messageID":"msg_0b9de79e5001cQDU0oUnxBaNkv","type":"tool","id":"call_00_VUIrzEoBJWCn2PkBCy8y2118","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp/deal_data.py","oldString":"    why=\"“During this period, J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process, including three strategic parties (not counting Industry Participant) and 24 financial participants (including potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers)” (p. 23). Date bounded by “since the August 13 board meeting” and “the middle of August through the end of October”.\",","newString":"    why=\"“During this period, J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process, including three strategic parties (not counting Industry Participant) and 24 financial participants (including potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers)” (p. 23). Date bounded by “since the August 13 board meeting” and “the middle of August through the end of October”. Conflict preserved: the reasons section states “more than 25 potential participants” (p. 27); the specific 27 is used and both are shown in the Summary.\","},"output":"Edited work_tmp/deal_data.py (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"work_tmp/deal_data.py","patch":"Index: work_tmp/deal_data.py\n===================================================================\n--- work_tmp/deal_data.py\n+++ work_tmp/deal_data.py\n@@ -167,9 +167,9 @@\n     when=\"mid-August through 10/31/2014\",\n     who=\"24 financial participants (cohort)\",\n     what=\"Contact\", process=1, round=0, type=\"Financial\",\n     terms=\"Inbound sale-process contacts of the 27 potential participants disclosed for the period from the middle of August to the end of October 2014: 24 financial participants (potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers). Spans the run-up to Round 1; assigned to Round 0 as the pre-opening contact wave.\",\n-    why=\"“During this period, J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process, including three strategic parties (not counting Industry Participant) and 24 financial participants (including potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers)” (p. 23). Date bounded by “since the August 13 board meeting” and “the middle of August through the end of October”.\",\n+    why=\"“During this period, J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process, including three strategic parties (not counting Industry Participant) and 24 financial participants (including potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers)” (p. 23). Date bounded by “since the August 13 board meeting” and “the middle of August through the end of October”. Conflict preserved: the reasons section states “more than 25 potential participants” (p. 27); the specific 27 is used and both are shown in the Summary.\",\n     source=\"P-016; P-017\", review=\"Q1; Q2\", count=24,\n     date_from=\"08/14/2014\", date_to=\"10/31/2014\", working=\"08/14/2014\",\n     date_basis=\"Approximate window\", date_method=\"Assigned: bound\", page=23,\n ))\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited work_tmp/deal_data.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp/deal_data.py\", \"oldString\": \"    why=\\\"“During this period, J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process, including three strategic parties (not counting Industry Participant) and 24 financial participants (including potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers)” (p. 23). Date bounded by “since the August 13 board meeting” and “the middle of August through the end of October”.\\\",\", \"newString\": \"    why=\\\"“During this period, J.P. Morgan was contacted by 27 potential participants in a sale process, including three strategic parties (not counting Industry Participant) and 24 financial participants (including potential lead buyers as well as large suppliers of equity capital to lead buyers)” (p. 23). Date bounded by “since the August 13 board meeting” and “the middle of August through the end of October”. Conflict preserved: the reasons section states “more than 25 potential participants” (p. 27); the specific 27 is used and both are shown in the Summary.\\\",\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824762669,"end":1789824763414}}}}
