0–41). Signing is not an additional bid; price cells and formality/conditionality cells left blank per instruction.\",\n-    source=\"P-036; X-032; X-031; X-015\", review=\"Q6\",\n+    source=\"P-036; X-032; X-031; X-015; X-018; X-020; X-021\", review=\"Q6\",\n     date_from=\"12/14/2014\", date_to=\"12/14/2014\", working=\"12/14/2014\",\n     date_basis=\"Reported day\", date_method=\"Reported\",\n     currency=\"USD\", all_cash=\"Yes\", cash_close=83.0, page=26,\n     related=\"R037 (winning bid); R041; R043\",\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited work_tmp/deal_data.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp/deal_data.py\", \"oldString\": \"    source=\\\"P-036; X-032; X-031; X-015\\\", review=\\\"Q6\\\",\", \"newString\": \"    source=\\\"P-036; X-032; X-031; X-015; X-018; X-020; X-021\\\", review=\\\"Q6\\\",\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824765402,"end":1789824765720}}}}
