e of the Company (as well as other strategic alternatives) and that … Longview would consider … rolling part or all of its holdings into equity of the acquiring entity rather than receive cash consideration” (p. 22). The filing describes Longview as “a long-term investor” (p. 29).\\\",\", \"path\": \"/home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp/deal_data.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789825070847,"end":1789825071507}}}}
