{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789825161434,"sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9e4955c001LH5N7QwkFvUwbM","sessionID":"ses_f462b66afffeUYg2nY8b6hqAEy","messageID":"msg_0b9e481a3001KmOl186wr2nqCq","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ICfhL0qKD3GSt1md2xhH9110","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"    why=\"“The board had initially targeted Monday, December 15 for completion of the sale process, and had initially set Friday, December 5 as the date for submission of bids”; “on December 4 and December 5, 2014, after consultation with the Company’s financial and legal advisors, the ad hoc committee concluded that these matters could be accomplished in a shorter period of time”; “the Company set the evening of Wednesday, December 10 (five days, rather than 10 days prior to the anticipated December 15 completion date) as the deadline for submission of final bids” (pp. 24–25).\",","oldString":"    why=\"“The board had initially targeted Monday, December 15 for completion of the sale process, and had initially set Friday, December 5 as the date for submission of bids”; “on December 4 and December 5, 2014, after consultation with the Company’s financial and legal advisors, the ad hoc committee concluded that these matters could be accomplished in a shorter period of time, which would reduce the risk of leaks or unintended public disclosure”; “the Company set the evening of Wednesday, December 10 (five days, rather than 10 days prior to the anticipated December 15 completion date) as the deadline for submission of final bids” (pp. 24–25).\",","path":"/home/uctpiaj/work/work_tmp/deal_data.py"},"output":"Edited work_tmp/deal_data.py (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"work_tmp/deal_data.py","patch":"Index: work_tmp/deal_data.py\n===================================================================\n--- work_tmp/deal_data.py\n+++ work_tmp/deal_data.py\n@@ -465,9 +465,9 @@\n     when=\"12/04–1